PoxRouteTrainer_Text_Challenge::
	.string "Let's see what the local POKéMON\ncan do!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Text_Defeat::
	.string "That was a good route battle!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Text_After::
	.string "Every member of my team lives\nsomewhere along this route.$"

PoxRouteTrainer_Route46_Text_Challenge::
	.string "My team trains on rocky ground.\n"
	.string "Let's see if it paid off!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route46_Text_Defeat::
	.string "You kept your footing!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route46_Text_After::
	.string "GEODUDE rolls right over rocks.\n"
	.string "MACHOP likes to lift them.\p"
	.string "I just trip over them.\n"
	.string "We all have our talents!$"

PoxRouteTrainer_Route24_Text_Challenge::
	.string "My shift is over. Now I can\ngive this battle my full effort!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route24_Text_Defeat::
	.string "You made me work for it!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route24_Text_After::
	.string "I come out here after work.\nBattling clears my head.\pThat fellow won't battle me.\nI'm glad you came along!$"

PoxRouteTrainer_Route25_Text_Challenge::
	.string "My POKéMON love our cape walks.\nWe stop for every battle!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route25_Text_Defeat::
	.string "You've earned the right of way!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route25_Text_After::
	.string "We're taking the walk slowly now.\nThey've earned a good rest.\pI like hearing their footsteps\nbeside mine on the path.$"

PoxRouteTrainer_Route44_Text_Challenge::
	.string "I've waited all day for a bite.\nHow about a battle instead?$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route44_Text_Defeat::
	.string "You reeled me right in!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route44_Text_After::
	.string "A fishing line needs patience.\nA battle needs good timing.\pI'm still better at waiting.\nMy SLOWPOKE seems to approve.$"

PoxRouteTrainer_Route103_Text_Challenge::
	.string "The breeze keeps us cool here.\nMy team can battle all day!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route103_Text_Defeat::
	.string "I'm out of breath already!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route103_Text_After::
	.string "WINGULL enjoys the sea breeze.\nLOTAD prefers a quiet puddle.\pI do my best to please both.\nWe take a lot of breaks!$"

PoxRouteTrainer_Route29_Text_Challenge::
	.string "My SENTRET spotted you first!\n"
	.string "It's eager for a battle.\p"
	.string "MAREEP and I are ready, too!\n"
	.string "Let's see your team!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route29_Text_Defeat::
	.string "We got ahead of ourselves!$"
PoxRouteTrainer_Route29_Text_After::
	.string "SENTRET sees a trainer and\n"
	.string "expects me to win every time.\p"
	.string "I ought to spend less time\n"
	.string "boasting and more time training.$"
